2	 * Meta Asset Creation Service
3	 *
4	 * Handles creation of Meta assets (ad accounts, product catalogs) for client connections.
5	 * Follows the security pattern of retrieving tokens from Infisical (never stored in DB).
6	 * All creation events are logged for audit purposes.
7	 */
